00:13:39,752 --> 00:13:41,498
so exponential time complexity.

331
00:13:42,193 --> 00:13:45,022
Now time complexity with that dynamic

332
00:13:45,168 --> 00:13:47,447
programming approach, so with memoization,

333
00:13:48,977 --> 00:13:51,174
there we actually have O,

334
00:13:54,373 --> 00:13:57,104
where c is our capacity. Now why n*c?

335
00:13:58,582 --> 00:14:01,580
Because we depend on both, we depend on our

336
00:14:01,708 --> 00:14:04,064
capacity and we depend on our

337
00:14:04,754 --> 00:14:07,415
length, our items length, a bit like with

