342
00:14:16,136 --> 00:14:17,867
We depend on both here because

343
00:14:18,460 --> 00:14:21,233
for a bigger capacity, we have more options

344
00:14:21,266 --> 00:14:23,414
that we need to evaluate, more possible

345
00:14:23,430 --> 00:14:24,119
